#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:5
#: 287d582350b042898b4307e103bcfe52
msgid "ODroid Wifi Access Point for sharing files via Samba"
msgstr "ODroid Wifi 接入点（通过 Samba 共享文件）"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:8
#: c18ceb515b9148c9800046012d4af47e
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:10
#: d1b7ca983c4b41499c4169283a4362ed
msgid ""
"This page will show you how to setup an Odroid with a Wifi AccessPoint so "
"that the Odroid's hard drive can be accessed and modified from another "
"computer.  This is primarily aimed at allowing access to images, videos and "
"log files on the Odroid.  The procedure makes use of `hostapd "
"<http://wireless.kernel.org/en/users/Documentation/hostapd>`__, `Samba "
"<https://www.samba.org/>`__ and `dhcp "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dynamic_Host_Configuration_Protocol>`__."
msgstr ""
"本页将介绍如何在 ODroid 上配置 Wifi 接入点，使其硬盘可从另一台计算机访问和修改。这主要是为了允许访问 ODroid "
"上的图像、视频和日志文件。该过程使用了 `hostapd "
"<http://wireless.kernel.org/en/users/Documentation/hostapd>`__、`Samba "
"<https://www.samba.org/>`__ 和 `dhcp "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dynamic_Host_Configuration_Protocol>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:18
#: b504981e06424cc29104b009fa5c4d72
msgid "To accomplish this you will need:"
msgstr "要实现此功能，您需要："

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:20
#: ff890d28e8184b83a15c9400bb3295df
msgid ""
"Odroid U3 running Ubuntu 14.04 as described on :ref:`this page <odroid-via-"
"mavlink>`."
msgstr "运行 Ubuntu 14.04 的 ODroid U3，如 :ref:`本页 <odroid-via-mavlink>` 所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:21
#: f5d78ded7ed5413fa77cd7d685f85493
msgid ""
"A Wifi dongle capable of \"master\" mode (aka \"AP\" or access point). These"
" exact instructions were performed with an $8 `Buffalo Airstation 11n 11g/b "
"USB2 wireless LAN terminal purchased in Japan <http://www.yamada-"
"denkiweb.com/1265136015>`__."
msgstr ""
"支持「master」模式（即「AP」或接入点模式）的 Wifi 加密狗。这些说明是使用在日本购买的 8 美元 `Buffalo Airstation "
"11n 11g/b USB2 无线局域网终端 <http://www.yamada-denkiweb.com/1265136015>`__ 完成的。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:24
#: 0775a9837a3f472693002961a4f0a8d9
msgid ""
"All the instructions below can be implemented by connecting a keyboard, "
"mouse and screen to the Odroid or using ssh (via Putty)."
msgstr "以下所有说明均可通过将键盘、鼠标和屏幕连接到 ODroid 或使用 SSH（通过 Putty）来实现。"

