#: bd8e9b2ecb1b4689ab2defbe86cfd2f0
msgid "Install hostapd, samba and all the other required packages:"
msgstr "安装 hostapd、samba 及所有其他必需软件包："

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:43
#: cb282b86ccc54cfc921d850d1a656805
msgid "Setting up the Access Point"
msgstr "设置接入点"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:45
#: cea6c156f30449c4a18e5ceebd4927a6
msgid "After first ensuring the wifi dongle is plugged into the Odroid,"
msgstr "首先确认 Wifi 加密狗已插入 ODroid，然后："

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:47
#: b4f5588c82cb450aa4d758e9e7af39ae
msgid ""
"Find the name of your wifi dongle by typing ``ifconfig`` (normally it will "
"be \"**wlan0**\\ \" or \"**wlan2**\\ \")"
msgstr "输入 ``ifconfig`` 查找 Wifi 加密狗的名称（通常为「**wlan0**」或「**wlan2**」）"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:53
#: 5971061a939848ee825ec18d303fe196
msgid "Check the wifi dongle supports \"AP\" mode:"
msgstr "检查 Wifi 加密狗是否支持「AP」模式："

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:59
#: e32aec36c744402197ac093e686aedeb
msgid ""
"A huge list of information will be displayed, you are looking for a section "
"called \"Supported interface modes:\" followed by \"\\* AP\".  If you cannot"
" find this then these instructions will not work and you should try with "
"another dongle."
msgstr ""
"将显示大量信息，您需要查找名为「Supported interface modes:」的部分，其后跟有「\\* "
"AP」。如果找不到，则这些说明将无法工作，您应尝试更换其他加密狗。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:71
#: 9392cec100104c869965fb5394031d25
msgid ""
"Use your favourite editor (nano or vi perhaps) to edit the "
"``/etc/network/interfaces`` file and add an entry for your wifi dongle. Note"
" you should replace \"wlan2\" if your dongle has a different name:"
msgstr ""
"使用您喜欢的编辑器（如 nano 或 vi）编辑 ``/etc/network/interfaces`` 文件，为您的 WiFi "
"适配器添加一条条目。注意，如果您的适配器名称不是 \"wlan2\"，请相应替换："

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:75
#: 53fd3b5b083d42f091f072d73ecb2e95
msgid "``auto wlan2``"
msgstr "``auto wlan2``"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:77
#: 75aeb32b1ee9456990a36b96cc80cac1
msgid "iface **wlan2** inet static"
msgstr "iface **wlan2** inet static"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:79
#: 12f87dd788fa4859934e8fa7fc42c037
msgid "address 192.168.100.1"
msgstr "address 192.168.100.1"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-wifi-access-point-for-sharing-files-via-samba.rst:81
#: a8f046ec88d4428a8817d460853439ba
msgid "netmask 255.255.255.0"
msgstr "netmask 255.255.255.0"

